{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Who brought you out of Egypt.</b> But below it says 'who brought us out.' This comes to teach that the redemption of the fathers is the redemption of the sons, and this is what we say in the Haggadah: 'Not our fathers alone did the Holy One, blessed be He, redeem, but even us He redeemed with them,' as it is said: ״ואותנו הוציא משם למען הביא אותנו לתת לנו את הארץ אשר נשבע לאבותינו״."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:58:34.151397789Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}